    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070700/extras/3cbcc0ff6c1534cfaf9373297a4ba7e7.avif?t=1744661706\" data-has-big width=800 height=179 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070700/extras/a7c832fa24881b8a02e615634dbdfe5b.avif?t=1744661706\" data-has-big width=800 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into KeyBound, a thrilling rogue-vania platformer where you inhabit a vivid world inspired by keyboards. Embark on an epic quest to recover lost keys and restore functionality to your fractured keyboard. Each key you retrieve brings back essential logic, crucial for rebuilding the realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through intricately connected maps fraught with perilous traps and adversaries, including rebellious keys and formidable bosses. Your skills will be tested in intense combat scenarios where strategic thinking and swift reflexes are key to survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of this unique universe as you journey deeper into its depths. Equip yourself with powerful abilities and charms crafted from the very keys you recover, enhancing your capabilities as you progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of exploration in a world filled with surprises and challenges, where every decision shapes your path forward. With its blend of roguelike unpredictability and metroidvania exploration, KeyBound promises endless replayability and excitement for adventurers of all kinds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embark on this daring mission to reclaim what's lost and restore order to the keyboard realm? The fate of the digital world rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070700/extras/f95f0ede693b82cf6a3d3272b7e63219.avif?t=1744661706\" data-has-big width=800 height=178 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070700/extras/3cbcc0ff6c1534cfaf9373297a4ba7e7.avif?t=1744661706\" data-has-big width=800 height=179 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070700/extras/a7c832fa24881b8a02e615634dbdfe5b.avif?t=1744661706\" data-has-big width=800 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into KeyBound, a thrilling rogue-vania platformer where you inhabit a vivid world inspired by keyboards. Embark on an epic quest to recover lost keys and restore functionality to your fractured keyboard. Each key you retrieve brings back essential logic, crucial for rebuilding the realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through intricately connected maps fraught with perilous traps and adversaries, including rebellious keys and formidable bosses. Your skills will be tested in intense combat scenarios where strategic thinking and swift reflexes are key to survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of this unique universe as you journey deeper into its depths. Equip yourself with powerful abilities and charms crafted from the very keys you recover, enhancing your capabilities as you progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of exploration in a world filled with surprises and challenges, where every decision shapes your path forward. With its blend of roguelike unpredictability and metroidvania exploration, KeyBound promises endless replayability and excitement for adventurers of all kinds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embark on this daring mission to reclaim what's lost and restore order to the keyboard realm? The fate of the digital world rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070700/extras/f95f0ede693b82cf6a3d3272b7e63219.avif?t=1744661706\" data-has-big width=800 height=178 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a thrilling rogue-vania platformer adventure in a keyboard-inspired realm. Reclaim lost keys to restore your keyboard, each one bringing logic back to the realm. Explore interconnected maps, battle rogue keys, and confront unique bosses in this epic quest!",
